      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T02:27:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, `sk_make_sp` requires that the type has a public constructor that it can call and Device is private. I definitely prefer `sk_make_sp` over `sk_sp(new T)` but I prefer that over the friend syntax to get `sk_make_sp` happy.",
      "parentUuid": "370baa76_7629964f",
      "revId": "12cf090868308d6b7d2c301da77d204bd9cd766e",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
